  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local Government Initiatives on Climate change LoGIC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LoGIC is to promote local action on climate change adaptation at scale. It will address climate change impact in Bangladesh. LoGIC is designed to support 200,000 most vulnerable households in 72 unions in 7 districts. Project duration is 48 months.</narrative>
  </description>
